1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:07,974
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni siku moja ya mtu anayeishi na kufanya kazi nje ya nchi.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Mwanzo wa Siku Mpya

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,560
Ninapofumua macho.

4
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:18,183
Naona dari jeupe.

5
00:00:18,206 --> 00:00:22,073
Hapa ni Tokyo.

6
00:00:22,096 --> 00:00:26,296
Jina langu ni Lin.

7
00:00:26,319 --> 00:00:29,158
Nimetoka Marekani.

8
00:00:29,181 --> 00:00:32,352
Chumba kina utulivu sana.

9
00:00:32,376 --> 00:00:36,542
Naweza kusikia tu sauti ya saa.

10
00:00:36,565 --> 00:00:39,344
Ninafungua dirisha.

11
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:43,614
Upepo baridi unavuma.

12
00:00:43,638 --> 00:00:47,644
Siku mpya inaanza.

13
00:00:47,667 --> 00:00:52,513
Leo pia nitakuwa naishi katika jiji hili kubwa.

14
00:00:52,537 --> 00:00:55,612
Ninakunywa kahawa.

15
00:00:55,636 --> 00:00:58,646
Ina joto.

16
00:00:58,669 --> 00:01:03,002
Ninajiandaa na kutoka nje.

17
00:01:03,026 --> 00:01:05,966
Ninatembea mpaka kituo cha treni.

18
00:01:05,989 --> 00:01:09,389
Kuna watu wengi.

19
00:01:09,412 --> 00:01:13,246
Wote wanakwenda wapi?

20
00:01:13,269 --> 00:01:16,635
Hakuna mtu anayenijua.

21
00:01:16,658 --> 00:01:19,708
Ninahisi upweke kidogo.

22
00:01:19,732 --> 00:01:24,189
Aa, Lin, habari za asubuhi.

23
00:01:24,212 --> 00:01:28,900
Aa, Tanaka, habari za asubuhi.

24
00:01:28,924 --> 00:01:31,376
Leo pia umefika mapema.

25
00:01:31,399 --> 00:01:35,850
Ndiyo, napenda hewa ya asubuhi.

26
00:01:35,873 --> 00:01:38,942
Ni vizuri.

27
00:01:38,966 --> 00:01:43,011
Tanaka pia huwasili mapema daima.

28
00:01:43,034 --> 00:01:48,367
Ndiyo, napenda treni za asubuhi.

29
00:01:48,390 --> 00:01:50,957
Kuna watu wachache.

30
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:56,580
Ndiyo. Treni zilizojaza watu zinaweza kuwa na hofu kidogo.

31
00:01:56,603 --> 00:02:01,203
Wajapani pia hawapendi treni zilizojaza watu.

32
00:02:01,226 --> 00:02:04,629
Ni vizuri kusikia hivyo. Nimejisikia nafuu.

33
00:02:04,653 --> 00:02:07,219
Treni imefika.

34
00:02:07,242 --> 00:02:10,279
Ndiyo, twende pamoja.

35
00:02:10,303 --> 00:02:13,570
Nimesikia sauti ya Tanaka.

36
00:02:13,593 --> 00:02:17,926
Hisia za upweke zimenywa kidogo.

37
00:02:17,949 --> 00:02:21,082
Sio mimi peke yangu.

38
00:02:21,106 --> 00:02:24,473
Leo pia ninaenda kazini.

39
00:02:24,496 --> 00:02:25,996
Sehemu ya 2: Ukuta wa Kanji na Kazi

40
00:02:25,996 --> 00:02:28,533
Nimefika kazini.

41
00:02:28,556 --> 00:02:30,923
Ninafungua kompyuta.

42
00:02:30,946 --> 00:02:33,919
Kuna barua pepe nyingi.

43
00:02:33,942 --> 00:02:36,987
Zote ni kwa Kijapani.

44
00:02:37,011 --> 00:02:40,683
Kanji ni ngumu sana.

45
00:02:40,706 --> 00:02:44,673
Nafanya kazi ya kubuni.

46
00:02:44,695 --> 00:02:47,362
Nina uwezo wa kubuni.

47
00:02:47,386 --> 00:02:51,157
Lakini ukuta wa lugha ni mrefu.

48
00:02:51,180 --> 00:02:54,747
Wakati mwingine naona kama ninataka kulia.

49
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:57,903
Nafanya mipigo mikubwa ya pumzi.

50
00:02:57,926 --> 00:03:01,093
Lin, uko sawa?

51
00:03:01,116 --> 00:03:06,249
Aa, Bwana Tanaka. Ndiyo, hakuna matata.

52
00:03:06,272 --> 00:03:10,080
Ulikuwa ukipumua kwa sauti kubwa.

53
00:03:10,104 --> 00:03:15,171
Samahani. Kanji kidogo ni ngumu.

54
00:03:15,194 --> 00:03:17,427
Ni kanji ipi?

55
00:03:17,450 --> 00:03:20,458
Kanji hii katika barua pepe.

56
00:03:20,482 --> 00:03:25,765
Aa, hii inasomwa 'kakunin'.

57
00:03:25,788 --> 00:03:28,222
Kakunin, basi?

58
00:03:28,245 --> 00:03:32,578
Ndiyo. Inamaanisha 'kuangalia' au 'kuhakiki'.

59
00:03:32,601 --> 00:03:34,671
Nimeelewa. Asante sana.

60
00:03:34,694 --> 00:03:37,227
Unaweza kutumia kamusi pia.

61
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:40,549
Ndiyo. Kila wakati ninatumia.

62
00:03:40,573 --> 00:03:44,340
Kama usielewi, uliza wakati wowote.

63
00:03:44,363 --> 00:03:48,051
Bwana Tanaka, wewe daima ni mpole.

64
00:03:48,074 --> 00:03:52,052
Tuko katika timu moja. Ni jambo la kawaida.

65
00:03:52,076 --> 00:03:54,681
Ninasaidiwa sana kweli.

66
00:03:54,705 --> 00:03:57,992
Leo mchana, tutakuwa na mkutano, sivyo?

67
00:03:58,015 --> 00:04:01,182
Ndiyo. Nimekamilisha nyaraka.

68
00:04:01,205 --> 00:04:04,538
Basi, unionyeshe baadaye.

69
00:04:04,561 --> 00:04:06,832
Sawa.

70
00:04:06,856 --> 00:04:11,728
Sikufanya kazi peke yangu.

71
00:04:11,751 --> 00:04:14,390
Kuna watu wanaonisaidia.

72
00:04:14,414 --> 00:04:18,580
Kwa hiyo, nataka kujifunza zaidi.

73
00:04:18,603 --> 00:04:22,883
Nataka kuongea Kijapani vizuri zaidi.

74
00:04:22,907 --> 00:04:25,240
Leo pia, nitafanya bidii.

75
00:04:25,263 --> 00:04:26,763
Sehemu ya 3: Chakula cha mchana bustanini

76
00:04:26,763 --> 00:04:29,530
Ni wakati wa chakula cha mchana.

77
00:04:29,553 --> 00:04:32,120
Nipo bustanini.

78
00:04:32,143 --> 00:04:35,281
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri.

79
00:04:35,304 --> 00:04:37,970
Anga ni buluu sana.

80
00:04:37,993 --> 00:04:41,127
Ninakumbuka anga la Marekani.

81
00:04:41,151 --> 00:04:44,518
Nimeandaa chakula cha mchana.

82
00:04:44,541 --> 00:04:48,314
Kuna tamagoyaki na onigiri.

83
00:04:48,337 --> 00:04:52,571
Chakula cha Kijapani ni cha kuvutia sana.

84
00:04:52,594 --> 00:04:55,462
Ina hisi ya kuwa ni aibu kula.

85
00:04:55,485 --> 00:04:59,285
Bibi Lin. Hapa, ni sawa?

86
00:04:59,308 --> 00:05:03,395
Bwana Tanaka. Ndiyo, karibu.

87
00:05:03,419 --> 00:05:08,076
Chakula kinacho kuliwa nje ni tamu, sivyo?

88
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:11,975
Ndiyo. Upepo una hisi nzuri.

89
00:05:11,998 --> 00:05:15,972
Chakula cha mchana cha Bibi Lin, ni kizuri sana!

90
00:05:15,995 --> 00:05:18,729
Nimefanya mwenyewe.

91
00:05:18,751 --> 00:05:22,362
Tamagoyaki yako ni nzuri sana.

92
00:05:22,386 --> 00:05:24,153
Asante.

93
00:05:24,176 --> 00:05:28,257
Lakini, nina wasiwasi kidogo kuhusu ladha.

94
00:05:28,281 --> 00:05:31,455
Naweza kupata moja?

95
00:05:31,478 --> 00:05:34,377
Ndiyo, karibu.

96
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,268
Jaribu kula.

97
00:05:36,291 --> 00:05:38,424
Nitakula.

98
00:05:38,447 --> 00:05:42,614
Hmm, ni tamu sana!

99
00:05:42,637 --> 00:05:44,415
Kweli?

100
00:05:44,438 --> 00:05:46,522
Nafurahi sana.

101
00:05:46,546 --> 00:05:50,679
Inapendeza na tamu kidogo. Nzuri sana.

102
00:05:50,702 --> 00:05:54,635
Siku moja nitapika chakula cha Kimarekani pia.

103
00:05:54,658 --> 00:05:57,192
Ninangojea sana hiyo.

104
00:05:57,215 --> 00:06:01,661
Mtu atakula kile nilichokifanya.

105
00:06:01,684 --> 00:06:04,851
Atasema ni tamu.

106
00:06:04,874 --> 00:06:09,240
Maneno hayo yanajaza moyo wangu.

107
00:06:09,263 --> 00:06:15,147
Katika chombo kidogo cha chakula, kuna pahali pangu.

108
00:06:15,170 --> 00:06:18,747
Naona nitaweza kufanya kazi yangu ya alasiri vizuri.

109
00:06:18,771 --> 00:06:20,271
Sehemu ya 4: Kujirekebisha baada ya kushindwa / Kuvumilia Kosa na Kubadilisha Hali ya Moyo

110
00:06:20,271 --> 00:06:24,161
Saa tisa za mchana.

111
00:06:24,184 --> 00:06:27,671
Nje kunanyesha mvua.

112
00:06:27,694 --> 00:06:31,698
Nipo chumbani cha maji moto.

113
00:06:31,722 --> 00:06:35,928
Kulikuwa na kosa nililofanya kwenye kazi.

114
00:06:35,952 --> 00:06:40,235
Nimekosea maana ya Kijapani.

115
00:06:40,259 --> 00:06:44,196
Nimeunda muundo usiofaa.

116
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:47,594
Ninahisi njaa sana.

117
00:06:47,617 --> 00:06:52,950
Natazama uso wangu kwenye kioo.

118
00:06:52,973 --> 00:06:56,507
Uso wangu una huzuni.

119
00:06:56,529 --> 00:07:00,896
Bibi Lin, ungependa kunywa kahawa?

120
00:07:00,919 --> 00:07:03,565
Bwana Tanaka.

121
00:07:03,588 --> 00:07:07,922
Kosa hutokea kwa kila mtu.

122
00:07:07,945 --> 00:07:11,945
Lakini muda umepotea.

123
00:07:11,968 --> 00:07:14,141
Hakuna matata.

124
00:07:14,165 --> 00:07:18,379
Muundo wako wa Bibi Lin ni mzuri sana.

125
00:07:18,403 --> 00:07:20,136
Asante.

126
00:07:20,159 --> 00:07:24,326
Mimi pia nilikuwa na makosa mengi zamani.

127
00:07:24,349 --> 00:07:26,915
Bwana Tanaka pia?

128
00:07:26,938 --> 00:07:30,792
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo usijali.

129
00:07:30,815 --> 00:07:36,015
Kwa nini Bwana Tanaka ni mpole kiasi hivi?

130
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:40,684
Mimi pia nilifanya kazi nchi za kigeni.

131
00:07:40,708 --> 00:07:43,241
Kweli?

132
00:07:43,264 --> 00:07:49,431
Ndiyo. Ninajua ugumu wa kutokuelewana kwa lugha.

133
00:07:49,454 --> 00:07:53,220
Unaelewa hisia zangu.

134
00:07:53,243 --> 00:07:57,046
Kwa hiyo, usilie peke yako.

135
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:59,236
Asante sana.

136
00:07:59,259 --> 00:08:03,593
Sasa, tuanze muundo mpya.

137
00:08:03,616 --> 00:08:06,782
Nitakwenda kufanya mara moja.

138
00:08:06,805 --> 00:08:12,045
Mvua nje bado inanyesha.

139
00:08:12,069 --> 00:08:17,568
Lakini mvua ya moyo wangu imesimama.

140
00:08:17,591 --> 00:08:21,391
Kuna mtu ananitazama.

141
00:08:21,414 --> 00:08:25,892
Hiyo pekee inanifanya niwe imara.

142
00:08:25,916 --> 00:08:27,416
Sehemu ya 5: Ujasiri katika Maonyesho na Lugha ya Kijapani / Ujasiri katika Maonyesho na Kujua Kijapani

143
00:08:27,416 --> 00:08:31,149
Leo ni siku muhimu.

144
00:08:31,172 --> 00:08:35,140
Nitakuwa na maonyesho ya muundo mpya.

145
00:08:35,164 --> 00:08:39,059
Mikono yangu inachezacheza kidogo.

146
00:08:39,083 --> 00:08:43,016
Niliwa na ujasiri Marekani.

147
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:48,880
Lakini hapa lazima nizungumze kwa Kijapani.

148
00:08:48,903 --> 00:08:52,637
Lugha inanifanya niwe mdogo.

149
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:56,557
Nafanya pumzi kubwa.

150
00:08:56,580 --> 00:09:00,980
Silaha yangu siyo lugha pekee.

151
00:09:01,003 --> 00:09:06,089
Silaha yangu ni muundo huu.

152
00:09:06,113 --> 00:09:09,127
Bibi Lin, mkutano utakuwa hivi punde.

153
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:13,193
Ndiyo. Ninasikitika sana.

154
00:09:13,217 --> 00:09:15,550
Pumzika kidogo.

155
00:09:15,573 --> 00:09:19,206
Ninaweza kukosea Kijapani.

156
00:09:19,229 --> 00:09:23,062
Kijapani si kitu muhimu zaidi.

157
00:09:23,085 --> 00:09:24,728
Eh?

158
00:09:24,752 --> 00:09:28,519
Kitu muhimu ni hisia zako, Bibi Lin.

159
00:09:28,542 --> 00:09:31,944
Hisia zangu?

160
00:09:31,967 --> 00:09:36,234
Nieleze hisia ulizonazo kwenye muundo huu.

161
00:09:36,257 --> 00:09:39,691
Ndiyo. Nimeelewa.

162
00:09:39,714 --> 00:09:43,714
Mimi nipo karibu nawe, usiwe na wasiwasi.

163
00:09:43,737 --> 00:09:47,337
Kukiwa na Bwana Tanaka, naona amani.

164
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:50,193
Basi, twende?

165
00:09:50,216 --> 00:09:53,391
Ndiyo, naomba unisaidie.

166
00:09:53,414 --> 00:09:56,748
Ninafungua mlango wa chumba cha mkutano.

167
00:09:56,771 --> 00:09:59,737
Wote wananiangalia.

168
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:03,257
Lakini sasa sina hofu tena.

169
00:10:03,281 --> 00:10:08,614
Nitawaleta hisia zangu za moto, kama zilivyo.

170
00:10:08,637 --> 00:10:13,676
Ninamwamini muundo wangu.

171
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:17,933
Wote, tazama muundo wangu.

172
00:10:17,956 --> 00:10:20,013
Naomba mnisaidie.

173
00:10:20,036 --> 00:10:22,636
Mkutano unaanza.

174
00:10:22,659 --> 00:10:26,793
Ninasimama na kutazama mbele.

175
00:10:26,816 --> 00:10:28,316
Sehemu ya 6: Machweo na Hisia

176
00:10:28,316 --> 00:10:32,049
Uwasilishaji umekwisha.

177
00:10:32,072 --> 00:10:36,672
Nipo kwenye dari la ofisi.

178
00:10:36,695 --> 00:10:41,095
Machweo yanageuza mbingu kuwa nyekundu.

179
00:10:41,118 --> 00:10:44,685
Nyekundu nzuri sana.

180
00:10:44,708 --> 00:10:50,674
Hakuna mtu kwenye dari hili, ni pahala pa siri kwangu.

181
00:10:50,697 --> 00:10:55,231
Upepo unanikumbatia uso wangu.

182
00:10:55,254 --> 00:11:01,303
Wote walinipongeza kwa muundo wangu.

183
00:11:01,326 --> 00:11:06,222
Kijapani changu kilikuwa kibaya, lakini hisia zangu ziliwasilika.

184
00:11:06,246 --> 00:11:10,658
Nimefurahi, machozi yangu yanatoka kidogo.

185
00:11:10,682 --> 00:11:14,348
Bibi Lin, nilikuita.

186
00:11:14,371 --> 00:11:17,305
Aa, Bwana Tanaka.

187
00:11:17,328 --> 00:11:19,661
Ulikuwa hapa.

188
00:11:19,684 --> 00:11:23,484
Ndiyo. Nilikuwa nikitazama jua linavyokucha.

189
00:11:23,507 --> 00:11:28,040
Uwasilishaji wako leo ulikuwa wa ajabu.

190
00:11:28,063 --> 00:11:30,997
Ni kwa sababu ya wewe, Bwana Tanaka.

191
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:35,053
Hapana, ni nguvu zako, Bibi Lin.

192
00:11:35,076 --> 00:11:38,131
Asante sana, kweli.

193
00:11:38,154 --> 00:11:42,843
Wote walisema wanapenda muundo wako.

194
00:11:42,866 --> 00:11:46,400
Kusikia hivyo, ninafurahi.

195
00:11:46,423 --> 00:11:50,556
Kutoka sasa, utakuwa na kazi nyingi zaidi.

196
00:11:50,579 --> 00:11:54,579
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

197
00:11:54,602 --> 00:11:58,969
Ukishikwa na uchovu, turudie hapa tena.

198
00:11:58,992 --> 00:12:00,725
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

199
00:12:00,748 --> 00:12:03,915
Napenda mandhari hii.

200
00:12:03,938 --> 00:12:07,874
Basi, turudi chini?

201
00:12:07,897 --> 00:12:09,664
Ndiyo.

202
00:12:09,687 --> 00:12:14,853
Jua linazama, taa zinawaka mjini.

203
00:12:14,876 --> 00:12:18,282
Usiku wa Tokyo unaanza.

204
00:12:18,306 --> 00:12:24,717
Nyota hazionekani, lakini taa za mjini zinazunguka zinafanana na nyota.

205
00:12:24,741 --> 00:12:30,975
Katika nuru hii, naweza kujitahidi zaidi kidogo.

206
00:12:30,998 --> 00:12:34,816
Mungu na atupe siku njema kesho.

207
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,340
Mstari wa 7: Matembezi ya Usiku Kwenye Dukani ya Karibu / Evening Convenience Store Stroll

208
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:39,306
Saa mbili za usiku.

209
00:12:39,329 --> 00:12:42,581
Nimeondoka kwenye ofisi, ninaenda kwa miguu.

210
00:12:42,605 --> 00:12:47,338
Hewa baridi ya barabarani inanifurahisha.

211
00:12:47,361 --> 00:12:50,031
Nimeingia dukani.

212
00:12:50,054 --> 00:12:54,254
Kuna mwanga mzuri na muziki.

213
00:12:54,277 --> 00:12:59,010
Duka za Japani ni mahali pa ajabu.

214
00:12:59,033 --> 00:13:01,367
Kuna kila kitu.

215
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:05,625
Ninunua chai moto na vitabu vya chakula.

216
00:13:05,648 --> 00:13:08,248
Karibu.

217
00:13:08,271 --> 00:13:10,709
Nitachukua hivi, tafadhali.

218
00:13:10,732 --> 00:13:13,366
Chai na vitabu vya chakula, ndivyo?

219
00:13:13,389 --> 00:13:16,322
Kiasi ni mia tatu na hamsini shilingi.

220
00:13:16,345 --> 00:13:19,878
Ndiyo, hivi tafadhali.

221
00:13:19,901 --> 00:13:22,040
Hii ni pesa yako ya rudisho.

222
00:13:22,064 --> 00:13:24,697
Asante kila wakati.

223
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,390
Eh?

224
00:13:26,413 --> 00:13:29,892
Unanikumbuka?

225
00:13:29,916 --> 00:13:31,683
Ndiyo.

226
00:13:31,706 --> 00:13:35,344
Unakuja mara kwa mara baada ya kazi, ndiyo?

227
00:13:35,367 --> 00:13:37,734
Ndiyo, ni mimi.

228
00:13:37,757 --> 00:13:41,924
Asante kwa kazi ngumu kila siku hadi usiku.

229
00:13:41,947 --> 00:13:44,280
Asante.

230
00:13:44,303 --> 00:13:48,103
Kunywa chai moto ili kupumzika kidogo.

231
00:13:48,126 --> 00:13:51,526
Ndiyo, ninafurahi sana.

232
00:13:51,549 --> 00:13:53,560
Karibu tena.

233
00:13:53,583 --> 00:13:56,916
Ndiyo, lala salama.

234
00:13:56,939 --> 00:13:59,632
Nimeondoka dukani.

235
00:13:59,656 --> 00:14:04,289
Mfanyakazi wa duka alinikumbuka uso wangu.

236
00:14:04,312 --> 00:14:09,179
Nilifikiri Tokyo ni mji mkubwa na baridi.

237
